{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, players explore the first level of a randomly generated tower, battling enemies with scaling health as they loop through the level. Experiment with a fully implemented drink-building system, combining ingredients to craft unique abilities that enhance your character\u2019s agility and combat prowess. Collect temporary upgrades to survive increasingly challenging enemy waves, and provide feedback to shape the final drink mechanics. The demo focuses on testing this core system in a single, dynamic level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE DEMO VS FULL RELEASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only first level available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >run loops through the 1st level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 1 enemies health scales up with each loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some permanent upgrades are locked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported Languages: English </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Modes: Single-player only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story and game have an ending</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with new enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doesn't loop like the demo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All permanent upgrades are available</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported Languages: Multiple</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0The point of the demo is to get player feedback on drink builds which are the main focus of the game. The drinks are fully implemented and should only be changed if the community finds something unsatisfying or a way it could work better.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AGILITY FIRST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\